# For GitHub's Languages bar (Linguist).

# The port's baron sources. Linguist has no 6502 language and doesn't know
# the .6502 extension, so without this they aren't counted at all.
*.6502 linguist-language=Assembly

# SkoolKit control files, which Linguist takes for Visual Basic 6.0 by their
# extension. Text keeps them out of the bar and shows them as plain text.
*.ctl linguist-language=Text
